## Acceptance criteria

Format: {{ac_format}} <!-- GEN: Given/When/Then or the team's own -->

- One behavior per AC; observable by a user or through the API.
- No implementation words (class names, tables) unless the AC is about an API contract.
- Each AC cites its source and goal as the `requirements.md` template requires.

