## Change jobs: delta

For a new `vN` of built behavior, classify each affected BR and AC against the code at the baseline revision:

| Kind | Means | Also write |
|---|---|---|
| ADDED | Behavior that does not exist in the built code | — |
| MODIFIED | Built behavior that changes | The full new wording in `requirements.md`; what changed, in one line |
| REMOVED | Built behavior that goes away | Reason and migration note (existing data, users, clients) |

BR (and workflow, endpoint, screen) changes go into `change-impact.md` → "Behavior delta"; AC changes go into "AC delta" as Add / Change / Remove (unaffected: Keep), each tracing to a behavior row. How to trace and prove each row: {{change_impact_link}}.

## Bug specs

Required: steps to reproduce · where it was found (DEV / STG / PROD) · expected vs actual · affected users and data · regression scope. {{bug_extra_fields}}

